meta {
  name: Ready
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/ready
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Ready

  `200 { "status": "ok" }` if Postgres is reachable (runs `SELECT 1`), else
  `503 { "status": "unavailable" }`. Reconnection is lazy — no retry loop, the next
  request is what attempts a fresh connection.
}
